# Vicius Docs Sync

The external docs live at **`nefarius/docs.nefarius.at`** → `docs/projects/Vicius/*.md`, published at <https://docs.nefarius.at/projects/Vicius/>.

## When to update

Propose a doc update whenever a change is **user-facing**:

- New/removed/renamed CLI flag (`NV_CLI_*`)
- New/changed/removed app exit code (`NV_E_*`)
- New/changed field in the remote or local JSON config schema
- New/changed default behavior visible to the operator or end user
- New feature area (emergency, ZIP, signature, busy detection, templates, …)
- UI-visible behavioral change

Pure internal refactors, code-style changes, or build-system tweaks do **not** require a doc update.

## Delivery (guidance-only)

Do **not** clone or push to the docs repo. Instead:

1. Identify which page(s) are affected (see mapping below).
2. Fetch the current content from `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nefarius/docs.nefarius.at/master/docs/projects/Vicius/<Page>.md` if you need context.
3. Output a concrete proposed markdown snippet or diff the maintainer can paste into that file.

## Source → docs-page mapping

| Source area | Files | Docs page |
|---|---|---|
| CLI flags & server URL default | `src/Common.h` (`NV_CLI_*`), `src/main.cpp`, `src/CustomizeMe.h` | `Command-Line-Arguments.md`, `Server-Discovery.md` |
| App exit codes | `src/Common.h` (`NV_E_*`) | `Exit-Codes.md` |
| Setup/installer exit-code handling | `src/models/` (`ExitCodeCheck`), `src/InstanceConfig.Setup.cpp` | `Setup-Exit-Codes.md` |
| Remote config schema | `src/models/SharedConfig.hpp`, `MergedConfig.hpp`, `UpdateResponse.hpp`, `UpdateRelease.hpp`, `UpdateConfig.hpp` | `Remote-Configuration.md` |
| Local config / INI | `src/models/InstanceConfig.hpp`, `src/InstanceConfig.cpp` | `Local-Configuration.md` |
| Product detection | `src/models/ProductDetection.hpp` | `Product-Detection.md` |
| Signature verification | `src/models/SignatureValidation.hpp`, `src/NAuthenticode.cpp`, `src/InstanceConfig.Security.cpp` | `Signature-Verification.md` |
| Download integrity / checksums | `src/Crypto.cpp`, `src/InstanceConfig.Download.cpp` | `Download-Integrity.md` |
| Terminate-before-update / busy detection | `src/models/ProductBusyDetection.hpp`, `src/InstanceConfig.ProductInUse.cpp` | `Terminate-Process-before-Update.md` |
| ZIP extraction | `src/models/DownloadLocationConfig.h` | `ZIP-Archives.md` |
| Inja templating | `src/InstanceConfig.Template.cpp` | `Inja-Templates.md` |
| Logging (log-level flag) | `src/main.cpp` | `Logging.md` |
| Emergency feature | `src/InstanceConfig.Web.cpp` | `Emergency-Feature.md` |
| UI / markdown changelog rendering | `src/ui.cpp`, `src/markdown.cpp`, `src/UI.h` | `index.md`, `Common-Errors.md` |

> **Cross-reference:** The remote/local config schema is also dual-maintained with `abstractions/src/Models/**` (covered by `model-parity.mdc`). When schema fields change, update both the C# mirror **and** `Remote-Configuration.md` / `Local-Configuration.md`.
